WEBVTT

00:04:59.079 --> 00:05:00.954
You have to lose weight for the dress.”

00:05:00.954 --> 00:05:03.454
I was like, “How about
I just get a dress that fits?”

00:05:03.454 --> 00:05:04.746
(Laughter)

00:05:04.746 --> 00:05:06.663
What a novel concept.

00:05:07.204 --> 00:05:09.496
I’m not going to buy
a dress that’s too small

00:05:09.496 --> 00:05:11.413
and then starve myself,

00:05:11.413 --> 00:05:12.996
so that the day of my wedding,

00:05:12.996 --> 00:05:16.496
they have to staple it
to my crackhead-like body

00:05:16.496 --> 00:05:19.704
as I hobble down the aisle
like something out of “The Walking Dead.”

00:05:19.704 --> 00:05:21.288
Like I just walk down there like,

00:05:21.288 --> 00:05:23.538
(Zombie imitation) “I love you so much.

00:05:24.579 --> 00:05:26.246
Does anybody have a Capri Sun?

00:05:26.246 --> 00:05:27.413
I’m starving.”

00:05:27.413 --> 00:05:28.788
(Laughter)

00:05:29.704 --> 00:05:30.788
No ...